  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tertiary scholarships are offered to partner developing countries to progress development and workforce planning objectives.
This activity is for services to select 577 scholars from approximately 25 countries and to place them in New Zealand and Pacific tertiary institutions.
All services will be managed by&#xa0;operational partner, Education New Zealand.</narrative>
